        "color": 7,
        "width": 864,
        "height": 384,
        "content": "## Submit and poll batch\n\nSubmits the batch generation request to Bulkcertify, waits between checks, polls the batch status, and loops until the batch is marked complete."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "348d8b28-db6f-4210-8f6a-9a5782982401",
